<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines cuts o/night lending rate to 27 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippines cuts o/night lending rate to 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank cut its overnight lending rate to 27 percent from 30 percent, central bank governor Gabriel Singson said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The new rate will be effective Friday morning when the interbank call loan market reopens.</p>
<p>Earlier, Singson said the overnight borrowing rate had been cut to 25 percent from 28 percent.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
